The projected-space SSR tracing implementation in
packages/shader/src/ssr-trace.wgsl is adapted from the algorithms in Three.js
SSRShader and SSRNode at 4457aa3c5de4a05bbae4e0bee2d99d994c38a2bb.

The hashed alpha coverage implementation in
packages/shader/src/alpha-hash.wgsl is adapted from Three.js r184
src/renderers/shaders/ShaderChunk/alphahash_pars_fragment.glsl.js.

The lightweight lens post-processing implementation in
packages/render/src/features/lens-effects.ts references Three.js VignetteShader,
RGBShiftShader and FilmShader at b745e6cb7b098e4b56bb9a3dbb1ab0b480f35aa2.

The ghost placement of the lens flare implementation in
packages/render/src/features/lens-flare.ts references Three.js Lensflare at
d3b629c0c2097cec664ad16369bb6eae3b10e335.

